clypse (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Complete rewrite in Rust (from Python/PyQt6 prototype)
  * GTK4 + libadwaita native UI
  * Wayland zwlr-data-control-v1 event-driven clipboard monitoring
  * SQLite WAL + FTS5 full-text search history
  * systemd user service with Type=notify watchdog
  * Favorites system with persistent protection from auto-eviction
  * Renamed project from Nebulip to Clypse

